{#
    A list, and the marker is written here rather than by the item.

    An item does not know whether it is the third of an ordered set or a bullet
    of an unordered one, and it does not know what its own marker is worth in
    spaces — which is what the blocks under it have to be moved in by, or they
    leave the item they belong to.
#}
{%- autoescape false -%}
{%- for child in node.children -%}
{{ renderNode(child)|md_indent(node.isOrdered ? (loop.index0 + (node.start ?? 1)) ~ '. ' : '- ') }}
{% endfor %}
{% endautoescape %}